  "description": "Kim Seo-Yun, who was recuperating from war injuries, happens to rescue a young wolf cub Suin in the mountains. Seo-Yun names him Yeon-Ho and takes him in as his son. Yeon-Ho, who had been distrustful of people, gradually begins to open up under Seo-Yun’s care, and before long, he comes to see Seo-Yun as more than just a father and mentor. Then one day, Seo-Yun accidentally witnesses Yeon-Ho masturbating…\n\n *“Can’t you come in and take a look? I keep getting an erection…”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
